"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "Used to capture photos of objects so they can be reconstructed into 3D models on this device. Photos and models stay on this device and are never uploaded.";

"NSMotionUsageDescription" = "Used to read gyroscope and accelerometer data to record the device's own motion as camera poses, reducing drift in 3D reconstruction. The data is processed only on this device.";

"NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription" = "Used to save preview images of exported models to your photo library. The app never reads anything from your photo library.";
